Actor- Team member

Description: The Team member uses the Population Reporting System to view population reports. The system get the data from the database  and displays it. Reports are read-only, so nothing is changed.

Scope: A single country is chosen by the Team member

Triger: The Team member opens the Population Reporting System and chooses to view report.

Preconditions: The database is running and contains the country, city and language data.
The chosen country exists in the database

Reports available (from the diagram)
1. View countries ranked by population
